function readCollectionPlanForm(){return {durationDays:Number($('#collectionPlanDuration')?.value||14),startDate:$('#collectionPlanStart')?.value||'',additionalLitresPerDay:$('#collectionPlanMilk')?.value||'',minimumFatPercent:$('#collectionPlanFat')?.value||'',minimumSnfPercent:$('#collectionPlanSnf')?.value||'',qualityFocus:$('#collectionPlanFocus')?.value||'balanced',incentivePerLitre:$('#collectionPlanBonus')?.value||'',budget:$('#collectionPlanBudget')?.value||'',capacityLitresPerDay:$('#collectionPlanCapacity')?.value||'',paymentTerms:$('#collectionPlanPayment')?.value?.trim()||'',termsConfirmed:Boolean($('#collectionPlanConfirmed')?.checked)}}
function validateCollectionPlan(plan){if(![14,21].includes(Number(plan.durationDays)))return 'Choose a 14-day or 21-day plan.';if(!plan.startDate)return 'Choose a start date for the plan.';for(const key of ['additionalLitresPerDay','minimumFatPercent','minimumSnfPercent','incentivePerLitre','budget','capacityLitresPerDay'])if(String(plan[key]).trim()===''||!Number.isFinite(Number(plan[key]))||Number(plan[key])<0)return 'Complete the milk, quality, incentive, budget, and capacity fields with valid non-negative values.';if(Number(plan.additionalLitresPerDay)<=0||Number(plan.incentivePerLitre)<=0||Number(plan.minimumFatPercent)<=0||Number(plan.minimumSnfPercent)<=0)return 'Milk target, fat/SNF thresholds, and incentive rate must be greater than zero.';if(Number(plan.minimumFatPercent)>15||Number(plan.minimumSnfPercent)>20)return 'Check the fat and SNF percentages; the entered value is outside the supported range.';if(Number(plan.capacityLitresPerDay)<Number(plan.additionalLitresPerDay))return 'The additional milk target cannot exceed the entered daily collection capacity.';const maxCost=Number(plan.additionalLitresPerDay)*Number(plan.durationDays)*Number(plan.incentivePerLitre);if(Number(plan.budget)<maxCost)return `Budget is below the maximum plan cost of ₹${maxCost.toLocaleString('en-IN',{maximumFractionDigits:0})}.`;if(!plan.paymentTerms)return 'Enter when and how the incentive will be paid.';if(!plan.termsConfirmed)return 'Confirm that the quality criteria, capacity, budget, and incentive terms are approved before preparing a farmer draft.';return ''}
